W AX3048 368-deprecated-nested-value.ax:22:16-22 deprecated-name "`oldLen` is deprecated" #"declared `;@axiom:deprecated(use (newLen v) instead)`" ?"the declaration says: use (newLen v) instead. It still works, and it still compiles - a deprecation is a notice, not a refusal. It may be removed in a later release, and `compat/BREAKING`'s rule lets that happen without a declared break precisely because this notice shipped first"
